{"id":"55157d609cf296e7","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-monotonicity.md","title":"固定偏序上的算子单调性","display":"df-monotonicity — 固定偏序上的算子单调性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-monotonicity","aliases":["91-df-monotonicity","91-df-jump-monotonicity","91-df-fixed-point-monotonicity"],"display":"df-monotonicity — 固定偏序上的算子单调性","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-monotonicity</span><span>91-df-jump-monotonicity</span><span>91-df-fixed-point-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-monotonicity — 固定偏序上的算子单调性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 为偏序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:L\\to L\">\\(J:L\\to L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Poset}\">\\(\\operatorname{Poset}\\)</span> 表示该关系反身、反对称、传递。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}\\)</span> 为下述性质；在幂集包含序上简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Poset}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\,[x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Poset}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\,[x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义适用于任何固定偏序，不需要先导入具体真理跳跃，故移除原来的逆向具体依赖。Knaster–Tarski 的固定点结论还需完备格；从一个非空种子上升迭代还需种子后固定条件。\nHalbach 的正算子 J 在全句子代码幂集上单调；其全体固定点可有过剩。一致固定点子类本身不是全幂集完备格。经典修正算子 Γ 不具有这里的信息单调性。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5 的正算子背景；一般偏序单调性的标准定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"J:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Poset}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\,[x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y)].","display":true}],"bytes":1349,"backlinks":[{"id":"1791b62b90bdbbfd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)$ 采用 [[91-df-monotonicity]] 的偏序单调性。"},{"id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为集合，$J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)$；$\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)$ 采用 [[91-df-monotonicity]] 的包含序单调性。"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-monotonicity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\